      "3. Markov-traced volume: V\u0302_i = z\u00b7a_i + b_i",
      "4. log|tr| = \u03a3_i log|V\u0302_i| (factorization theorem)",
      "5. Q_local = \u03a3_{converting strands} log|V\u0302_par/V\u0302_dau| / \u210f_q\u00b2"
